<section class="hero">
  <div class="container">
    <h1>The Well</h1>
    <h2>A sacred retreat for women who are tired of carrying it all.</h2>
    <p>Come as you are. Rest. Reflect. Be renewed. A Christ-centered weekend designed to create space for stillness, healing, and genuine connection with God and other women.</p>
    <a class="btn btn-primary btn-lg" href="{{ '/registration/' | url }}">Sign Up Now</a>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="intro">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="intro-text">
      <p>At The Well, women gather for a guided, shared weekend rooted in faith and connection.</p>
      <p>This women’s-only, three-day retreat brings women together in a peaceful setting for intentional sessions, worship, conversation, and meaningful shared experiences. Whether you arrive alone or with a friend, the weekend is designed so everyone begins together and moves through the experience side by side.</p>
      <p>The Well follows a gentle rhythm that balances guided moments with time to reflect, connect, and engage fully in the weekend.</p>
      <p>Some moments are shared.<br>Some moments are quiet.<br>All are intentional.</p>
      <p>The Well is not about having the right answers.<br>It is about showing up and being present.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="intro-logo">
      <img src="{{ '/assets/img/the-well-logo.png' | url }}" alt="The Well" width="200" height="200" loading="lazy">
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="features">
  <div class="container">
    <h3 class="features-heading">Inside <em>your</em> all inclusive stay</h3>
    <div class="feature-rows">
      <div class="feature">
        <div class="feature-media" role="img" aria-label="Women sharing a picnic together at The Well retreat" style="background-image: url('{{ '/assets/img/accommodations.jpg' | url }}')"></div>
        <div class="feature-body">
          <p class="eyebrow">Your Stay</p>
          <h3>3 Days, 2 Nights Accommodations</h3>
          <p>Cozy accommodations designed for comfort, quiet, and restoration. Private and shared spaces allow for both solitude and connection.</p>
          <p>This is a place to slow down, rest, and exhale.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="feature">
        <div class="feature-media" role="img" aria-label="Women talking together outdoors" style="background-image: url('{{ '/assets/img/guided-sessions.jpg' | url }}'); background-position: 50% 70%"></div>
        <div class="feature-body">
          <p class="eyebrow">Intentional</p>
          <h3>Guided Sessions &amp; Sacred Space</h3>
          <p>The sessions at The Well gently guide women through a shared journey of encounter, renewal, and growth.</p>
          <p>Through scripture, immersive experiences, guided reflection, and meaningful conversation, space is created to meet God through presence, not striving.</p>
          <p>You are never pressured to share.<br>You are simply invited to show up.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="feature">
        <div class="feature-media" role="img" aria-label="Women worshipping with hands raised" style="background-image: url('{{ '/assets/img/worship.jpg' | url }}'); background-position: 50% 70%"></div>
        <div class="feature-body">
          <p class="eyebrow">Soul-Filling</p>
          <h3>Live Worship &amp; Spiritual Renewal</h3>
          <p>Worship at The Well is unhurried and grounded in God’s presence.</p>
          <p>Through live worship led by a worship band, prayer, scripture, moments of stillness, and intentional reflection, women are invited to release burdens and receive peace.</p>
          <p>This is worship without performance.<br>Just presence.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="feature">
        <div class="feature-media" role="img" aria-label="A table of fresh food and pastries" style="background-image: url('{{ '/assets/img/meals.jpg' | url }}')"></div>
        <div class="feature-body">
          <p class="eyebrow">Nourishing</p>
          <h3>All Meals, Snacks &amp; Drinks Included</h3>
          <p>Meals at The Well are thoughtfully prepared and shared together.</p>
          <p>From morning coffee to evening meals, food is provided so you can remain present, cared for, and supported throughout the weekend.</p>
          <p>You will be fed well.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="feature">
        <div class="feature-media" role="img" aria-label="Two women laughing together by a campfire" style="background-image: url('{{ '/assets/img/sisterhood.jpg' | url }}')"></div>
        <div class="feature-body">
          <p class="eyebrow">Sisterhood</p>
          <h3>Meaningful Connection &amp; Community</h3>
          <p>Connection at The Well forms naturally.</p>
          <p>Women from different seasons gather, share space, and quickly realize they are not alone. Through conversation, laughter, and shared moments, genuine relationships take root.</p>
          <p>Many leave with friendships that last far beyond the weekend.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="weekend">
  <div class="container stack-center">
    <h3 class="section-title">What The Weekend Looks Like</h3>
    <div class="acc acc--boxed">
      <details open>
        <summary>Day One - Arrival &amp; Encounter</summary>
        <div class="acc-body">
          <p>Day One is about arriving, settling in, and slowing down.<br>The day includes:</p>
          <ul>
            <li>A warm welcome and time to get settled</li>
            <li>A gentle opening session teaching</li>
            <li>Space to rest, breathe, and begin connecting with other women</li>
            <li>Optional, simple creative activities available throughout the afternoon to support grounding and reflection</li>
            <li>An unhurried evening centered on worship and teaching, ending with sisters around a bonfire</li>
          </ul>
          <p>This day invites women to notice how they’re arriving and to respond with care rather than pressure.</p>
        </div>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>Day Two - Release &amp; Renewal</summary>
        <div class="acc-body">
          <p>Day Two is about creating space for rest, reflection, and gentle release.<br>The day includes:</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Optional morning exercise for those who wish to begin the day with gentle movement</li>
            <li>A morning teaching session</li>
            <li>Guided prayer and time for personal reflection</li>
            <li>Extended space for rest, quiet, and optional, hands-on activities designed to support reflection and renewal</li>
            <li>Time outdoors and moments of natural connection</li>
            <li>Evening worship followed by sisterhood around the bonfire</li>
          </ul>
          <p>This day creates space to acknowledge what has been carried and to be gently supported through it.</p>
        </div>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>Day Three - Rooted &amp; Sent</summary>
        <div class="acc-body">
          <p>Day Three is about gathering what has been experienced and preparing to move forward with renewed focus-eyes forward on what lies ahead rather than what’s behind.<br>The day includes:</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Morning worship to begin the final day together</li>
            <li>A closing teaching session</li>
            <li>Time for reflection and integration</li>
            <li>Prayer, encouragement, and a shared closing moment</li>
          </ul>
          <p>This day is about moving forward grounded, supported, and reminded you are not meant to carry life alone.</p>
        </div>
      </details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

